    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1 The extent to which areas related to knowledge (ability to acquire, disseminate and produce knowledge) are covered in the AKI
1.2 Number of new resources / content made available on the digital portal
1.3 Number of new knowledge products produced as a tool to foster development dialogue and debate on emerging issues, including gender issues (Reports, background papers, sub-indices to the AKI, etc.).
2.1 Number of participatory platforms fostered to promote linkages between knowledge and sustainable development at national and regional levels
2.2 Number of AKI citations

Indicators under the revised Project Document for the period 2020-2030:
Indicator 1.1. Number of knowledge products
Indicator 1. 2. Number of downloads and visitors to the Knowledge for All portal and knowledge products and number of Knowledge4All social media platforms followers
Indicator 1.3. Number of youth participants in workshops and trainings (sex-disaggregated)
Indicator 2.1. Number of knowledge-based strategies in Arab countries and beyond
Indicator 2.2. Level of implementation of skills gap assessment strategies [Low, moderate,
high, significant] (Number of countries benefiting from skills gap assessment strategies; Number of participants benefiting from training courses)</narrative>
    </description>
